      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I think you might have misunderstood me. I'm not looking for analogies, I just need the actual technical specs for the warehouse. Can you just explain the physics of the center of gravity and the specific interlocking patterns (like pinwheel vs. brick) we should use for heavy loads?",
